id: pm-gh1598
title: "GH-1598: bind batch mutation APIs to PmClient and expose canonical staged preview records"
description: "GitHub https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1598 requests native PmClient preview/commit methods bound to host root and author policy, plus canonical staged records for idempotent intent comparison. Current staged preview validation remains shipped; its result contains validation state, constraints and warnings rather than complete staged records."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-26T04:54:51.880Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-28T22:52:54.188Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-28T22:52:53.234Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-28T22:52:53.234Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: "Expose typed PmClient previewItemMutations and commitItemMutations forwarding bound root and author policy to the existing SDK coordinator; Return per-mutation canonical staged ids, normalized metadata and bodies with generated-value provenance and explicit commit-time constraints; Prove preview/read-back equivalence for unchanged admitted plans and safe identical-intent replay versus typed changed-intent conflicts using native non-Git fixtures; preserve read-only previews and current guarded commit behavior"
parent: pm-9rgaal
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: Delivered bound batch preview and commit with canonical staged records and safe preview bootstrap.Replay guarantees explicitly depend on retaining committed journals; GC removal can admit the identity as new.
expected_result: Packages can perform host-bound atomic batches and compare normalized intents using SDK-owned records instead of re-deriving roots or duplicating normalization.
actual_result: "Final review remediation validation: full suite passed with exact 100/100/100/100 source coverage (statements 71421/71421; branches 55026/55026; functions 14707/14707; lines 67487/67487). Linked recovery 65/65 and SDK/semantic-preview 49/49 passed again, as did build, typecheck, ESLint, contracts, SDK surface and docs links. Final packed artifact passed Node and Bun including changed-plan refusal for retired identities. Five pre-fix native cases returned the wrong plan-mismatch code; the fixed cases return transaction_abandoned and preserve state. Previous reviewed head 512184eb9 passed every required GitHub check including macOS and both performance gates; this revision still requires its own hosted checks and renewed review before merge."
